{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"started","call_id":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-3\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_1","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py","offset":1105,"limit":30}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-3\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_1","startedAtMs":"1793063494323"},"model_call_id":"554121ca-3ede-4a3f-a6c5-62d323bbe7d0-3-cafn","session_id":"64927e40-cd34-4ba8-892c-5ffed7c2791b","timestamp_ms":1793063494402}
{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-2\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_0","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/Мой диск/Context/models.md","offset":140,"limit":20},"result":{"success":{"content":"### Судьи `default` (N=6)\n\nСостав раунда — РОВНО 3 судьи, выбираются рандомно из рабочих моделей пула `default` заново на каждом раунде (п. 1.2; режим выбора: 3 разных семейства по `SEED`, без якоря). Недоступность — п. 1.4/1.8. Пул — запас для выбора и замен; запуск более 3 судей запрещён; источник замен для `fast`/`quality`; generic `acp-agents` — тот же состав.\n\n| Модель (pinned live ID) | effort | family | Режим выбора |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `gpt-6.1-sol` | `high` (на промежуточных раундах R1..R(N-1) разрешён `medium`) | OpenAI | 3 разных семейства по `SEED` |\n| `claude-sonnet-5-5` | `high` | Anthropic | то же; `Anthropic` ≤ 1 |\n| `claude-opus-5-5` | `high` | Anthropic | то же; `Anthropic` ≤ 1 |\n| `gemini-4-argon-high` | `high` | Google | то же |\n| `muse-wonder-full-1.0` | `high` | Meta | то же |\n| `grok-4.7-high` | `high` | xAI | то же |\n\n5 независимых семейств, 6 слотов: 3 сиденья выбираются из всех 6 (уникальность семейств), остальные — резерв замены.\n\n### Судьи `quality` (N=6)\n\nРовно 3 судьи из рабочих слотов пула `quality` разных семейств; `Anthropic` ≤ 1 (`claude-sonnet-5-5-xhigh` или `claude-opus-5-5-high`). Падение слота: рабочие транспорты слота → оставшийся слот `quality` → рабочие слоты `default` → п. 1.8. Не схлопывать панель в `default`, пока в `quality` есть живые слоты.\n\n| Слот (pinned live ID) | effort | family | Режим выбора |","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":212,"fileSize":41632,"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/Мой диск/Context/models.md","readRange":{"startLine":140,"endLine":159},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-2\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_0","startedAtMs":"1793063494288","completedAtMs":"1793063494435"},"model_call_id":"554121ca-3ede-4a3f-a6c5-62d323bbe7d0-3-cafn","session_id":"64927e40-cd34-4ba8-892c-5ffed7c2791b","timestamp_ms":1793063494464}
{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-3\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_1","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py","offset":1105,"limit":30},"result":{"success":{"content":"                        _ = sink_list.pop(0)\n                else:\n                    sink_deque: collections.deque[str] = sink\n                    _ = sink_deque.append(line)\n    except (OSError, ValueError):\n        pass\n\n\ndef _stop_proc(proc: subprocess.Popen[str]) -> None:\n    \"\"\"Остановить группу `opencode run` (SIGTERM -> SIGKILL); процесс запущен со start_new_session.\"\"\"\n    if proc.poll() is not None:\n        return\n    try:\n        os.killpg(proc.pid, signal.SIGTERM)\n        proc.wait(timeout=5)\n    except (OSError, subprocess.TimeoutExpired):\n        try:\n            os.killpg(proc.pid, signal.SIGKILL)\n        except OSError:\n            pass\n\n\n_STDOUT_POLL_S = 0.25\n\n\nclass _StdoutFeed:\n    \"\"\"Строки stdout дочернего процесса через ограниченную очередь: ожидание не блокируется навсегда.\n\n    Читатель — daemon-поток; без него `for raw in proc.stdout` не возвращает управление, пока CLI\n    молчит, и ни дедлайн, ни keepalive не срабатывают. `timed_out` выставляется, когда `lines()`","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":6992,"fileSize":317368,"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py","readRange":{"startLine":1105,"endLine":1134},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-3\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_1","startedAtMs":"1793063494323","completedAtMs":"1793063494436"},"model_call_id":"554121ca-3ede-4a3f-a6c5-62d323bbe7d0-3-cafn","session_id":"64927e40-cd34-4ba8-892c-5ffed7c2791b","timestamp_ms":1793063494466}
{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"started","call_id":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-4\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_2","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py","offset":1688,"limit":60}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-4\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_2","startedAtMs":"1793063494600"},"model_call_id":"554121ca-3ede-4a3f-a6c5-62d323bbe7d0-3-cafn","session_id":"64927e40-cd34-4ba8-892c-5ffed7c2791b","timestamp_ms":1793063494626}
{"type":"tool_call","subtype":"completed","call_id":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-4\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_2","tool_call":{"readToolCall":{"args":{"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py","offset":1688,"limit":60},"result":{"success":{"content":"        stat = target.stat()\n    except OSError:\n        _dynamic_config_cache.update({\"key\": None, \"value\": False, \"path\": str(target)})\n        return False\n    key = (stat.st_mtime_ns, stat.st_size)\n    if (\n        _dynamic_config_cache.get(\"path\") == str(target)\n        and _dynamic_config_cache.get(\"key\") == key\n    ):\n        return bool(_dynamic_config_cache.get(\"value\"))\n    value = False\n    try:\n        data = _as_dict(_loads_object(target.read_text(\"utf-8\")))\n        enabled_obj = data.get(\"REALTIME_SERVE_ENABLED\")\n        if isinstance(enabled_obj, bool):\n            value = enabled_obj\n    except OSError:\n        value = False\n    _dynamic_config_cache.update({\"key\": key, \"value\": value, \"path\": str(target)})\n    return value\n\n\n_dynamic_config_enabled = _read_dynamic_config_enabled\n\n\ndef _serve_permission_effect() -> str:\n    \"\"\"Эффект permission из env политики: ask_reject -> ask, deny -> deny.\"\"\"\n    policy = os.environ.get(\n        \"OPENCODE_ZEN_BRIDGE_SERVE_PERMISSION_POLICY\", \"ask_reject\"\n    ).strip()\n    if policy == \"ask_reject\":\n        return \"ask\"\n    if policy == \"deny\":\n        return \"deny\"\n    raise ServeSecurityError(f\"unsupported serve permission policy: {policy}\")\n\n\ndef _serve_env(model_id: str = \"\") -> dict[str, str]:\n    \"\"\"Санитизированное окружение serve на всех ветках маршрутизации.\"\"\"\n    base = _run_env(model_id)\n    env: dict[str, str] = {k: v for k, v in base.items() if k in _SERVE_ALLOWLIST}\n    _ = env.setdefault(\"PATH\", \"/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin\")\n    if \"HOME\" not in env and os.environ.get(\"HOME\"):\n        env[\"HOME\"] = str(os.environ[\"HOME\"])\n    if \"XDG_DATA_HOME\" not in env and os.environ.get(\"XDG_DATA_HOME\"):\n        env[\"XDG_DATA_HOME\"] = str(os.environ[\"XDG_DATA_HOME\"])\n    config_raw = env.get(\"OPENCODE_CONFIG_CONTENT\") or OPENCODE_CONFIG_CONTENT\n    config = _as_dict(_loads_object(config_raw)) if config_raw else {}\n    config[\"permission\"] = {\"*\": _serve_permission_effect()}\n    env[\"OPENCODE_CONFIG_CONTENT\"] = json.dumps(config, ensure_ascii=False)\n    state_dir = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\"zen-serve-state-\")\n    env[\"XDG_STATE_HOME\"] = state_dir\n    env[\"TMPDIR\"] = state_dir\n    env[\"OPENCODE_DB\"] = \":memory:\"\n    _ = env.pop(\"OPENCODE_BIN\", None)\n    env[\"OPENCODE_SERVER_PASSWORD\"] = secrets.token_hex(16)\n    return env\n\n\ndef _is_native_opencode_bin(path: str) -> bool:","isEmpty":false,"exceededLimit":false,"totalLines":6992,"fileSize":317368,"path":"/Users/aazhiry1/tmp/cli-agent-bridge/zen-realtime-reasoning/bridges/opencode-zen-bridge/server.py","readRange":{"startLine":1688,"endLine":1747},"relatedCursorRulePaths":[],"relatedCursorRules":[]}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call-f94bd4b9-697a-4dce-8d5d-d05432d584b4-4\nfc_fcada0f6-bed1-92c6-804f-abc8ef8f2e5b_2","startedAtMs":"1793063494600","completedAtMs":"1793063494655"},"model_call_id":"554121ca-3ede-4a3f-a6c5-62d323bbe7d0-3-cafn","session_id":"64927e40-cd34-4ba8-892c-5ffed7c2791b","timestamp_ms":1793063494682}
